            "heading": "BABY CARRIERS",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_LMjxLV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Mmm, baby head smell. Keep your little peanut happily nestled into you as you warm up a bottle or take your dog baby for a walk. With an Evenflo baby carrier, you can face your baby in/out or carry them on your back.<br/>Our baby carriers provide security and comfort for baby—and padding and support for you. They’re also easy to use, made with machine-washable fabrics, offer multiple modes, and make a great hiking baby carrier for longer treks.</p><p>• Multiple carrying positions <br/>• Padding for baby and parent’s comfort <br/>• Adjustable back straps <br/>• Secure lock buckles <br/>• For babies weighing 7 to 45 lb</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
