            "text": "<p>Evenflo playards and bassinets are the must-have travel companions for parents who need versatility and portability. Features include UPF+ sun protection canopies, pouches for touch-screen devices, mesh sides, and easy-to-clean padding. Great as a bedside bassinet, our cozy bassinets can be folded flat for an easy carry from room to room.</p><p>• Portability: Lightweight & easy to carry <br/>• Convenience: Easy to pack up and set up <br/>• Safety and comfort for baby <br/>• Machine-washable fabrics <br/>• Age range: From birth to toddler</p>",
