        "text_dGimj9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Squished blueberries…squash dribbles…flying macaroni…get ready for things to get messy. Let your child rise and dine with high chairs that are easy to adjust, clean, and fold up. <br/>Designed with safety and convenience in mind, our high chairs feature dishwasher safe tray liners, wipeable fabric seat pads, adjustable harnesses, and sturdy legs. For extended use, choose our 4-in-1 high chair that adapts to your child’s changing needs.</p><p>• Durability <br/>• Portability <br/>• Dishwasher safe tray liner <br/>• Easy-to-fold design <br/>• Age range: From 4 months to five years</p>",
