            "text": "<p>Baby’s got moves! Give your little bundle of energy a safe, fun place to giggle, wiggle and let you catch your breath.<br/>Create an instant play center with our doorway jumpers, stationary jumpers and activity centers for toddlers. Offered in a variety of bright, playful themes, they use toys and sounds to engage your baby’s senses, spark their imagination, encourage interaction, and get them moving.</p><p></p><p>• Durability <br/>• Pressure mounts for safety <br/>• Multiple uses (kids and pets) <br/>• Variety of styles to fit your decor <br/>• Easy assembly</p>",
