            "text": "<p>The Evenflo® Green&Gentle™ Sustainable Crib Mattress brings Evenflo’s high-quality, innovative touch to bedtime! Unlike foam mattresses, the Green&Gentle™ mattress is made from approximately 250 post-consumer recycled plastic bottles, to help your child grow up in a greener world. EcoFibril™ materials in the mattress core that are also VOC free, allow for better air flow through the mattress, to help create a cooler, more comfortable sleep environment for your child.</p>",
